  "intro": {
    "title": "Darf ich?",
    "paragraphs": [
      "Dürfen is about permission: Darf ich hier rauchen? (May I smoke here?). Like all modal verbs, it pushes the main verb to the end of the sentence. And nicht dürfen means 'must not', which surprises English speakers."
    ]
  },
